1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
This tutorial sets up a partner business
and a

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:06,000
coupon offer for the Tenants of Oasis
Crest Properties.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,334
As the Company Admin, open Promotions and

4
00:00:08,334 --> 00:00:10,667
select the Businesses tab, then Add
business.

5
00:00:10,667 --> 00:00:13,667
Enter the partner's name in English and
Arabic, choose

6
00:00:13,667 --> 00:00:16,668
its category, and add a phone and WhatsApp
number.

7
00:00:16,668 --> 00:00:20,668
Allowed link domains limit where this
business's ads may send a Tenant.

8
00:00:20,668 --> 00:00:22,668
Keep it Active and select Save.

9
00:00:22,668 --> 00:00:25,668
Now open the Ads tab and select Add ad.

10
00:00:25,668 --> 00:00:29,335
Choose the business, then give the ad a
short title and

11
00:00:29,335 --> 00:00:33,002
an eyebrow line in English and Arabic, and
a card colour.

12
00:00:33,002 --> 00:00:36,002
The preview on the right follows as you
type.

13
00:00:36,002 --> 00:00:39,669
Under What happens on tap, an ad can open
a website,

14
00:00:39,669 --> 00:00:43,002
show a coupon code, call the business or
open WhatsApp.

15
00:00:43,002 --> 00:00:45,336
Choose Show coupon code, then enter the

16
00:00:45,336 --> 00:00:47,669
code and its terms in both languages.

17
00:00:47,669 --> 00:00:50,003
There is no separate expiry date: the

18
00:00:50,003 --> 00:00:52,003
ad's end date ends the offer.

19
00:00:52,003 --> 00:00:55,336
Set the start and end dates and the
priority; a

20
00:00:55,336 --> 00:00:58,337
higher priority gets more airtime in the
home carousel.

21
00:00:58,337 --> 00:01:01,003
Where it shows chooses between the home
carousel

22
00:01:01,003 --> 00:01:03,337
and offers, or the offers screen only.

23
00:01:03,337 --> 00:01:06,337
Show to limits the ad to selected
properties, here

24
00:01:06,337 --> 00:01:09,337
the Residence Tower, so other buildings
never see it.

25
00:01:09,337 --> 00:01:12,004
Check the preview in Arabic, then select
Save.

26
00:01:12,004 --> 00:01:13,671
The new ad is Live.

27
00:01:13,671 --> 00:01:17,338
Views and Taps count how often Tenants see
and tap it

28
00:01:17,338 --> 00:01:21,005
in the mobile app, so a new ad starts at
zero.

29
00:01:21,005 --> 00:01:24,338
Filter by business to review everything
one partner is running.

30
00:01:24,338 --> 00:01:27,672
The ad stops showing on its own end date,
and

31
00:01:27,672 --> 00:01:30,672
its views and taps stay on the row, so

32
00:01:30,672 --> 00:01:33,672
you can judge whether the offer was worth
running.
